<section class="page-intro container"><div class="eyebrow">PLUGIN TOOLBOX / 插件生态</div><h1>按需选择，<br>让应用具备合适的能力。</h1><p>插件不会由核心自动启用。通过 Composer 自动加载或手动 require 后使用，并按具体插件准备扩展、配置和服务。</p></section><section class="container plugin-section"><div class="plugin-toolbar"><div class="case-filters" role="group" aria-label="插件分类"><button type="button" data-plugin-filter="all" aria-pressed="true">全部插件</button><button type="button" data-plugin-filter="base" aria-pressed="false">基础能力</button><button type="button" data-plugin-filter="data" aria-pressed="false">数据与缓存</button><button type="button" data-plugin-filter="extra" aria-pressed="false">扩展工具</button></div><label class="plugin-search">搜索插件<input type="search" id="plugin-search" placeholder="例如 STpl、JSON、数据库"></label></div><p id="plugin-status" role="status" class="result-count">插件清单 · 按需加载</p><div class="service-grid">{%foreach ($plugins as $plugin)%}<article class="plugin-card" data-plugin-type="{%htmlspecialchars($plugin['type'], ENT_QUOTES + ENT_SUBSTITUTE, 'UTF-8')%}"><div class="plugin-card-heading"><h2>{%htmlspecialchars($plugin['name'], ENT_QUOTES + ENT_SUBSTITUTE, 'UTF-8')%}</h2><span class="pill">{%htmlspecialchars($plugin['group'], ENT_QUOTES + ENT_SUBSTITUTE, 'UTF-8')%}</span></div><p>{%htmlspecialchars($plugin['text'], ENT_QUOTES + ENT_SUBSTITUTE, 'UTF-8')%}</p><div class="plugin-dependency"><span>运行条件</span>{%htmlspecialchars($plugin['need'], ENT_QUOTES + ENT_SUBSTITUTE, 'UTF-8')%}</div></article>{%/foreach%}</div><p id="plugin-empty" class="plugin-empty" hidden>没有找到匹配的插件。试试其他关键词或分类。</p><noscript><p>当前显示全部插件；启用 JavaScript 后可搜索与筛选。</p></noscript></section><section class="section container code-pair"><div><div class="eyebrow">JSON RESPONSE</div><h2>SJson：返回结构化数据</h2><div class="code-block"><button type="button" data-copy="json-code">复制</button><pre><code id="json-code">{%htmlspecialchars($code['json'], ENT_QUOTES + ENT_SUBSTITUTE, 'UTF-8')%}</code></pre></div></div><div><div class="eyebrow">TEMPLATE RENDERING</div><h2>STpl：组织页面模板</h2><div class="code-block"><button type="button" data-copy="tpl-code">复制</button><pre><code id="tpl-code">{%htmlspecialchars($code['tpl'], ENT_QUOTES + ENT_SUBSTITUTE, 'UTF-8')%}</code></pre></div></div></section><section class="container doc-panel"><h2>使用前，先确认依赖。</h2><p>Composer 包声明 PHP ≥ 8.0、PDO 和 Guzzle。独立核心与本仓库示例可以直接加载使用；数据库、Redis、图形等插件仍需对应扩展和服务。历史插件需逐项验证当前环境兼容性。</p><p>STpl 当前实现直接输出模板，不返回 HTML 字符串；SConfig 默认含进程内与临时文件缓存。具体行为请查看仓库文档。</p><a class="text-link" href="/workspace/main/plugins">运行配置解析与环境检测 →</a></section><div class="section"></div>
